# CODEOWNERS — automatic reviewer assignment for PRs.
#
# Format: <path-pattern>  @<github-handle>
# When a PR modifies a path matching a pattern, GitHub auto-assigns the
# listed handle as a reviewer. Combined with branch protection rule
# "Require review from Code Owners", this enforces ownership.
#
# Roles map to CONTRIBUTING.md "Roles" table.
# Until Role A / Role B collaborators join, all paths are owned by
# @hongikarchi (admin). When a collaborator joins, replace the relevant
# @hongikarchi entries with their GitHub handle. Invalid handles cause
# silent skip (no auto-assignment), not a hard error.

